window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Amazing boxset. Binge the entire series from start to finish!</b><br> <br> Lily's childhood was filled with darkness, but she managed to escape the dangers of human trafficking. Now, she is a strong federal agent on a mission for justice. However, the painful memories of her past still haunt her.</p> <p>One day, she meets Zayn, a mysterious man with a troubled history like her own. Their connection is electric, filled with passion and desire. They quickly fall into a heated romance, one that is both exciting and overwhelming.</p> <p>As they explore their intense feelings for each other, they face dangers from the outside world and must also confront their own inner struggles. Together, Lily and Zayn navigate the challenges of love while battling the shadows of their pasts.</p>"; 
